\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. My faith looks up to Thee,
\par Thou Lamb of Calvary,
\par Saviour divine:
\par Now hear me while I pray;
\par Take all my guilt away;
\par O let me from this day
\par Be wholly Thine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. May Thy rich grace impart
\par Strength to my fainting heart,
\par My zeal inspire;
\par As Thou hast died for me,
\par O may my love to Thee
\par Pure, warm, and changeless be,
\par A living fire.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. While life's dark maze I tread,
\par And griefs around me spread,
\par Be Thou my guide;
\par Bid darkness turn to day,
\par Wipe sorrow's tears away,
\par Nor let me ever  stray
\par From Thee aside.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. When ends life's transient dream,
\par When death's cold, sullen stream
\par Shall o'er me roll,
\par Blest Saviour, then, in love,
\par Fear and distrust remove;
\par O bear me safe above,
\par A ransomed soul.
\par                      Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
